     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hello Joe,<br><br>Thanks again for the hints. I managed to get a nearly \r\nworking app with two issues: (1) when I change the number of sliders, I \r\nget an error (it certainly has to do with proper cleaning of variables, \r\nno great deal); (2) the sliders &quot;wobble&quot; when I&#39;m moving one of them.<br><br>Point\r\n (2) is the one I have no idea how to fix. Whenever I move a slider \r\n(say, slider 1), the values of the other ones (say, #2 and 3) are \r\nupdated, as they should. But -- in my understanding-- this triggers the \r\nevent linked to sl2 and sl3. Therefore, slider 2 updates sl1 and sl3. \r\nwhich in turn triggers 1 and 3 ... etc., and the net result is that the \r\nsliders oscillate before reaching a stable point. Surely the solution is\r\n about isolating one of the controls, but right now I cannot find out \r\nwhat I should isolate() and where!<br><br>Thanks !<br><br>Here is the code...<br><br>---- ui.R-----------<br><br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">shinyUI</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">fluidPage</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Application title</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  titlePanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Demo app&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Three sliders for values a, b and c -- total must be 100%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  sidebarLayout</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    sidebarPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    numericInput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;num&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Number of sliders&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> value </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">3</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    uiOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sliders&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Write the result</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    mainPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>      textOutput</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;result&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>  </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br><br></span></div></code></div><br><br>--- server.R------------<br><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>shinyServer</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">session</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Define the names of the variables used to describe the sliders</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>slidernames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Placeholder</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#008\">as</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">character</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">seq</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input$num</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#008\">by</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1</span><span style=\"color:#660\">))</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># Read the slider values</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>slidervals</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">reactive</span><span style=\"color:#660\">({</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">lapply</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">slidernames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">function</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">input</span><span style=\"color:#660\">[[</span><span style=\"color:#000\">paste</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;sl&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">sep</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)]])</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>                </span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">unlist</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    names</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">slidernames</span><span style=\"color:#660\">()</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>    </span><span style=\"color:#008\">return</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">m</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">prop</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\">    <br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">})</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#800\"># The real meat of the code -- render the slider and create the binding</span></div></code></div></div>"
